attr configname ProposedA
attr datetime 20261112-16:19:45
attr datetimef 20261112-161945
attr experiment ProposedA
attr inifile omnetpp.ini
attr iterationvars $N=20
attr iterationvarsd N=20
attr iterationvarsf N=20-
attr measurement $N=20
attr network fogroam5g.Tarragona5G
